                                                "sense_id": "7cd94f85-9e2a-30de-9a05-94cbda05e65e",
                                                "text": "She was abused by, em... David, I think. That was his name, he's a real em... what's the word, narcissist. You should really stay away from him."
                                            }
                                        ]
